note sh_mix_sovf: an int value shifted left by a uchar amount: 1 by 30 is 2^30; 2 by 30 is 2^31, outside int,
note so omc traps 1 (exit 101) after the amount check passed. "o\n" comes first.
text t "o\n"
fn sho a int s uchar to int
ret shl a s
end
fn main to int
w = write 1 t 0 2
x = sho 1 30
if ne x 1073741824
ret 1
end
y = sho 2 30
ret and y 255
end
